  "name": "Table 67: Signature Smites",
  "img": "icons/svg/d20-grey.svg",
  "description": "<p><em>Rulebook Table 67 (p.314-315).</em> Each god has their own typical way of smiting. Use the signature smite for the first smite of a campaign, or let the dice tell you what to do (Tables 65/66). This is a reference list keyed by deity, not a numbered die-roll table in the book; ranges below are assigned in the rulebook's own alphabetical order purely for compendium/roll-tooling purposes.</p>",
  "results": [
