      "type": "text",
      "name": "Apito",
      "img": null,
      "description": "<p>The offender is banished to the Nothing (for NPCs) or nearly so (for PCs). PCs gain the Nearly Obliterated Debuff for the rest of the floor: they have only one HB slot and cannot regain any until the next floor.</p>",
