      "type": "text",
      "name": "Ogun",
      "img": null,
      "description": "<p>Ogun places a white-hot hand upon the head of the NPC offender until their skin is seared to the bone. PCs must pass a CON-check each round for 5 rounds. Each near miss deals 1 HB damage, 2 on a miss, 3 on a major failure, or 4 on a critical failure. These cannot be healed while the god's hand touches the crawler.</p>",
